   "description": "<p>At Barings, we are as invested in our associates as we are in our clients. We recognize those who work diligently for us and reward them for personal and professional integrity, communication skills, distinct competencies and expertise in specific strategies, ability to collaborate as a team member and true dedication to the interests of our clients.<br><br>We thank you for your interest in joining the Barings team, and invite you to explore our current employment opportunities. <br><br><b>Job Title</b>: Senior .NET Developer<br><br><b>Business Title</b>: Associate Director<br><br><b>Department</b>: Global Technology Department - Investment & Enterprise Technology<br><br><b>Location:</b> London, UK<br><br><b>Job Summary</b><br><br>Barings' Investment & Enterprise Technology team are seeking an experienced Senior .NET Developer with 7&#43; years of experience to build, enhance, and support enterprise applications. This role requires strong hands-on development in C#, deep SQL expertise focused on troubleshooting and data analysis, and the ability to deliver business-critical insights through Power BI. The developer will also support SaaS applications and contribute to the design of AI-driven solutions.<br><br><b>Key Responsibilities</b><br><br><b>Application Development</b></p> <ul> <li>Design, develop, and maintain applications using .NET (C#, ASP.NET Core)</li><li>Build and support APIs and integrations across internal and third-party systems</li><li>Ensure code quality, scalability, and performance across the full SDLC</li></ul> <b>SQL / Data Troubleshooting (Core Focus)</b> <ul> <li>Perform complex SQL querying and troubleshooting to support production issues</li><li>Analyse, debug, and resolve data-related defects and performance bottlenecks</li><li>Work closely with business users to investigate data discrepancies and ensure data integrity</li><li>Optimise queries and stored procedures for performance and efficiency</li></ul> <b>Power BI & Reporting (Key Skill)</b> <ul> <li>Design and develop Power BI dashboards and reports to support business decision-making</li><li>Translate business requirements into meaningful visualizations and data models</li><li>Ensure accuracy, consistency, and usability of reporting solutions</li></ul> <b>SaaS Application Support</b> <ul> <li>Provide L2/L3 support for SaaS and enterprise applications</li><li>Troubleshoot system and integration issues, performing root-cause analysis</li><li>Work across teams to maintain system stability and resolve incidents quickly</li></ul> <b>AI Solutions / Innovation</b> <ul> <li>Contribute to the design and development of AI-enabled solutions (automation, insights, workflows)</li><li>Identify opportunities to embed AI capabilities into existing systems and processes</li></ul> <b>Required Qualifications</b> <ul> <li>7&#43; years of experience in software development</li><li>Strong expertise in: <ul> <li>C# / .NET / ASP.NET Core</li><li>SQL (heavy focus on querying, troubleshooting, and data analysis)</li><li>Power BI (dashboarding, reporting, data modelling)</li></ul> </li><li>Experience supporting SaaS platforms and integrations</li><li>Proven ability to work on production support and issue resolution</li><li>Solid understanding of APIs, integrations, and enterprise system design</li><li>Experience working in Agile environments</li></ul> <b>Preferred Skills</b> <ul> <li>Experience with Azure cloud services</li><li>Exposure to AI/ML tools or building AI-powered features</li><li>Familiarity with data pipelines or ETL processes</li></ul> <b>Requisite Skills</b><br><br><b>Additional Skills</b><br><br>Barings is an Equal Employment Opportunity employer; Minority/Female/Age/Sexual Orientation/Gender Identity/Individual with Disability/Protected Veteran. We welcome all persons to apply. <br>",
