   "description": "<p>QA Systems Technical Manager</p> <p><strong>Location: Market Drayton, plus travel to other Muller Yoghurt and Desert Sites.</strong></p> <p><strong>Excellent salary, car allowance, Healthcare, 25 days holiday, bonus potential </strong></p> <p>Are you a passionate Quality professional who thrives on driving continuous improvement, food safety excellence and industry-leading quality standards?</p> <p>At Müller Yoghurts and Deserts, we're looking for a highly motivated QA Systems Technical Manager to take ownership of our Quality Management Systems (QMS) across our dairy manufacturing operations. This is a pivotal leadership role where you'll influence business-wide quality strategy, lead compliance excellence and ensure our sites remain audit-ready while continuously raising standards.</p> <p><strong>WHY JOIN MULLER YOGHURTS AND DESERTS </strong></p> <p>As one of the UK's leading food and dairy manufacturers, Müller supplies millions of consumers every day. This role offers the opportunity to work at the heart of our technical and quality function, partnering with operational and technical leaders to deliver world-class food safety, quality assurance and compliance standards.</p> <p><strong>THE OPPORTUNITY</strong></p> <p>Reporting to the Head of Quality, the QA Systems Technical Manager will lead the development, implementation and continuous improvement of Quality Management Systems across the business.</p> <p><strong>KEY RESPONSIBILITIES</strong></p> <p>• Lead and continuously improve the Quality Management System (QMS).<br>• Ensure compliance with BRCGS standards, retailer requirements and food legislation.<br>• Manage HACCP, VACCP and TACCP programmes.<br>• Lead audits, investigations and corrective action plans.<br>• Drive continuous improvement, food safety culture and governance.<br>• Manage specifications, risk assessments and technical compliance.<br>• Coach, mentor and develop quality team members.</p> <p><strong>WHAT WE'RE LOOKING FOR</strong></p> <p>Experience within Food Manufacturing, FMCG, Dairy Manufacturing or a regulated production environment, with strong knowledge of BRCGS, HACCP, food safety compliance, quality assurance systems, internal auditing, root cause analysis and continuous improvement. We are ideally looking for candidates with a relevant degree or HNC/HND</p> <p><strong>KEYWORDS</strong></p> <p>Quality Assurance Manager, QA Systems Manager, Technical Manager, Food Safety Manager, Quality Systems Manager, BRCGS, HACCP, VACCP, TACCP, Food Manufacturing Jobs, FMCG Jobs, Dairy Manufacturing, Quality Management System, Technical Compliance, Internal Auditor, Continuous Improvement and Quality Assurance Jobs.</p> <p><strong>INCLUSION & DIVERSITY</strong></p> <p>At Müller, we're committed to creating an inclusive workplace where everyone feels they belong. We know that diverse teams drive innovation, better decision-making and stronger business performance.</p> <p>We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, experiences and perspectives, and we encourage you to apply even if your experience doesn't perfectly match every requirement listed in this advertisement. If you're excited about this opportunity and believe you can make a positive impact, we'd love to hear from you.</p> <p>If you require any reasonable adjustments at any stage of the recruitment process, please let us know. We're committed to ensuring an accessible and supportive experience for all candidates.</p> <p><strong>READY TO APPLY?</strong></p> <p>If you're an experienced Quality Systems Manager, Technical Manager, Food Safety Manager, Quality Assurance Leader or BRCGS specialist looking for your next challenge within a leading FMCG manufacturer, we'd love to hear from you.<br><br></p> <p><strong>You can find out more about Müller and what it’s like to work for us by clicking here Careers at Müller UK & Ireland</strong></p>",
